#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Left click and drag the selection to move selected content.\n"
"Hold {0} to scale instead of move.\n"
"Right click and drag the selection to rotate selected content.\n"
"Hold Shift to rotate in steps.\n"
"Use arrow keys to move selected content by a single pixel."
msgstr ""
"Linkermuisknop en slepen om de geselecteerde inhoud te verplaatsen.\n"
"Houd {0} ingedrukt om de selectie te vergroten of verkleinen.\n"
